Characteristics of line
1. The line should appear as a straight line and it should start and end accurately.
2. The line should be displayed with constant brightness along its length independent and
orientation.
3. The line should be drawn rapidly.
Digital Differential Algorithm
1. Accept the endpoints(x1,y1) and (x2,y2)
2. Calculate dx = x2-x1
dy=y2-y1

3. If dx>dy
length =dx
else
length =dy
4. Calculate xinc = dx/length
yinc = dy/length

5. plot(x,y)
6. i=1
7. while(i<=length)
{
x=x+xinc
y=y+yinc
plot(x,y)
i=i+1;
}
8. Stop

